## Previously raised findings (review-round registry)

These defects were raised on earlier review rounds of this PR. For each finding below: verify fixed (cite the fixing hunk), withdraw (reason required), or mark re-introduced. New claims need new evidence — a claim already on this list is answered, not re-raised.

| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F1 | open | BLOCKING | test/integration/pty_harness.dart | 🚨 blocking the publish staging gate cannot compile this change — static gates red ci run 43851264755 the vendored fork is invisible to the staged publish tree pubspec overrides yaml pins pty2 → vendor pty2 the fork that exposes pid but scripts stage publish package sh excludes both vendor line 57 and pubspec overrides yaml line 59 so the staged tree re resolves hosted pty2 0 5 7 — which has no pid getter the gate s dart analyze of the staged tree then fails on exactly the pty pid references this pr adds reproduced locally with the repo s own gate flow bash scripts stage publish package sh tmp stage cd tmp stage dart pub get dart analyze fatal infos fatal warnings — byte identical to the ci log exit 3 error test integration pty harness dart 271 11 the getter pid isn t defined for the type pseudoterminal undefined getter error test integration pty harness dart 271 40 same error test integration pty harness dart 274 35 same error test integration pty harness kill escalation test dart 90 29 same error test integration pty harness kill escalation test dart 119 27 same 5 issues found note the pr s pre commit gate scope unaffected note is true for the test legs integration tagged files are excluded there but the publish dry run s staged analyze does stage and compile the test tree — that is the leg that s red the ticket contract is a green ref ticket md closes manually when the ref goes green so this blocks merge as is it also means the published payload would carry test files that don t compile against the published dependency set fix — follow the repo s own vendored dev dep precedent vendor xterm which is already staged as a path dev dependency pubspec yaml 90 91 stage includes at scripts stage publish package sh 52 pubignore 31 negation allowlist guard in test publish staging test dart 1 pubspec yaml dev deps replace pty2 0 5 3 with pty2 path vendor pty2 drop the now redundant pubspec overrides yaml pty2 entry